Hi {Owner},

I build websites for chiropractic clinics around {City}. {Business Name} has warm reviews, but no site where a nervous first-time patient can read which techniques you use, what a first visit costs and how to request one.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: adjustment techniques explained, an auto accident intake page, a sports section, a referral and records page for other providers, and a new patient request that keeps health details off the form. It uses marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes at lunch one day?

